{"4181110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "THE VIG", "steam_appid": 4181110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you once believed in collapses overnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e0252b764f2d484d0d8bb080586224a4.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e0252b764f2d484d0d8bb080586224a4.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e0252b764f2d484d0d8bb080586224a4.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Xie En</strong>, a brilliant architect. Betrayed by your mentor, you are reduced to a prisoner. While incarcerated, you receive the devastating news of your father's resentful death. To avenge them, you endure eight years of patient concealment, then return under the alias <strong>Wu Wei</strong>, infiltrating the enemy's headquarters—the <strong>Yongqiang Group</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/f7936012741713933ae304b89bf1f8d4.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/f7936012741713933ae304b89bf1f8d4.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/f7936012741713933ae304b89bf1f8d4.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The law cannot judge his hypocrisy, and hatred consumes your heart. This time, you decide to act on your own terms, walking the fine line of rules to weave an impeccable scheme. Your target is not his life, but the empire he holds dearer than life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, can Wu Wei succeed in his revenge and bring the mastermind to justice? How will he survive in this cutthroat corporate world? Everything hinges on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If one seeks to win, they must neither abide by the rules nor reject them outright—they must walk <i>between</i> the rules.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/6d4986cc50858c269b302567e9f700a2.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/6d4986cc50858c269b302567e9f700a2.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/6d4986cc50858c269b302567e9f700a2.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Meticulously Crafted Urban Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-IQ revenge power fantasy.Assume the dual identity of the protagonist, Xie En/Wu Wei, and execute a step-by-step, intricately layered revenge plan. This is no reckless outburst of rage, but a calm hunt where <strong>wisdom is your spear, and rules are your shield</strong>. Driven by clear objectives, you will never lose sight of your ultimate goal—even amid intertwined romantic subplots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/1afd4d62313be621c1a0fd19617d73a7.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/1afd4d62313be621c1a0fd19617d73a7.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/1afd4d62313be621c1a0fd19617d73a7.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Workplace Is a Battlefield: Only the Victor Reigns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave behind the illusion of peaceful coexistence. Use your wits and tactics to fight your way through the labyrinth of office politics and uncover the truth! Say goodbye to monotonous gameplay: the <strong>dynamic feedback system</strong> delivers the thrill of consequences with every decision. Meticulously designed character interactions will keep your heart racing and your senses on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/aef9aca09653d8bd995e050086b1c2b2.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/aef9aca09653d8bd995e050086b1c2b2.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/aef9aca09653d8bd995e050086b1c2b2.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Branches, Multiple Endings, Parallel Storylines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts nearly <strong>50 distinct endings</strong> and hundreds of plot branches. Every dialogue choice, every mission strategy, can steer the story onto a brand-new path. Will you bring total destruction to your enemies? Or escape unscathed? Will you drown in tender affection? Or forge ahead alone into danger? Step into the game, embrace the revenge, and write an ending that is uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/944607c298579093c5ce5bcc03a70afd.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/944607c298579093c5ce5bcc03a70afd.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/944607c298579093c5ce5bcc03a70afd.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive &amp; Engaging Game Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich variety of interactive gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· In tense, high-stakes <strong>QTE sequences</strong>, you must stay absolutely calm to ensure your actions leave <strong>no trace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Navigate the perilous corporate environment: choose to sneak in stealthily to gain the upper hand, or step into the fray when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e9591760d2b859df526f55fd4111410f.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e9591760d2b859df526f55fd4111410f.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e9591760d2b859df526f55fd4111410f.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/0457c301acbe2355390bb77a3322ffb6.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/0457c301acbe2355390bb77a3322ffb6.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/0457c301acbe2355390bb77a3322ffb6.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where choices are tangled in love and hate, right and wrong. On this cold path of revenge, will these passionate emotions become your greatest vulnerability? Or your most formidable strength? Every choice that tests your humanity carries the weight of a thousand jun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/861f565876d3d2fa5e64c40034c386e0.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/861f565876d3d2fa5e64c40034c386e0.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/861f565876d3d2fa5e64c40034c386e0.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/fc246cf1800e5abd679133ac98a800ef.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/fc246cf1800e5abd679133ac98a800ef.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/fc246cf1800e5abd679133ac98a800ef.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/556facc3e38f811c190c0c5650519948.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/556facc3e38f811c190c0c5650519948.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/556facc3e38f811c190c0c5650519948.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Xie En (Wu Wei)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a wrongfully imprisoned architect, now a ruthless avenger. Under the fake identity &quot;Wu Wei&quot;, he infiltrates his former mentor's Yongqiang Group and meticulously plots his revenge—using financial tactics to dismantle everything the mentor holds dear. This high-IQ hunt walks the razor's edge between <strong>rules and human nature</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/a6d69b8fcc4ea86a6bbeeb3d3801a4ac.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/a6d69b8fcc4ea86a6bbeeb3d3801a4ac.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/a6d69b8fcc4ea86a6bbeeb3d3801a4ac.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zhang Yun'er</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;queen&quot; of Yongqiang Group, Xie En's direct supervisor and &quot;benefactor&quot;. She is a paradox of rationality and sensibility. Little does she know that the capable subordinate she personally promoted is a hunter targeting the heart of her family empire. When unyielding business pragmatism collides with uncontrollable emotion, the line between hunter and prey begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/4edabbb80afe3047835aa570c449fb4b.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/4edabbb80afe3047835aa570c449fb4b.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/4edabbb80afe3047835aa570c449fb4b.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chen Xiaoman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious corporate accountant at the group. Her meteoric rise from a dancer to a core staff member is shrouded in enigma. Her relationship with Xie En starts as a dangerous game of mutual exploitation. In a world of scheming and temptation, whoever falls in love first will lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/8beea00f49750bab31865c89fe367ca6.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/8beea00f49750bab31865c89fe367ca6.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/8beea00f49750bab31865c89fe367ca6.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guan Xinling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seemingly innocent &quot;white rabbit&quot; of the group, hiding sharp observation skills and a rebellious heart behind her sketchbook. Desperate to break free from her cage, her transformation will be the <strong>biggest wildcard</strong> in Xie En's plan. She could be his purest redemption—or his deadliest flaw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/28730e9f819e70f29622c8ff7fe0c521.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/28730e9f819e70f29622c8ff7fe0c521.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/28730e9f819e70f29622c8ff7fe0c521.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you once believed in collapses overnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e0252b764f2d484d0d8bb080586224a4.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e0252b764f2d484d0d8bb080586224a4.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e0252b764f2d484d0d8bb080586224a4.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Xie En</strong>, a brilliant architect. Betrayed by your mentor, you are reduced to a prisoner. While incarcerated, you receive the devastating news of your father's resentful death. To avenge them, you endure eight years of patient concealment, then return under the alias <strong>Wu Wei</strong>, infiltrating the enemy's headquarters—the <strong>Yongqiang Group</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/f7936012741713933ae304b89bf1f8d4.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/f7936012741713933ae304b89bf1f8d4.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/f7936012741713933ae304b89bf1f8d4.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The law cannot judge his hypocrisy, and hatred consumes your heart. This time, you decide to act on your own terms, walking the fine line of rules to weave an impeccable scheme. Your target is not his life, but the empire he holds dearer than life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, can Wu Wei succeed in his revenge and bring the mastermind to justice? How will he survive in this cutthroat corporate world? Everything hinges on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If one seeks to win, they must neither abide by the rules nor reject them outright—they must walk <i>between</i> the rules.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/6d4986cc50858c269b302567e9f700a2.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/6d4986cc50858c269b302567e9f700a2.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/6d4986cc50858c269b302567e9f700a2.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Meticulously Crafted Urban Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-IQ revenge power fantasy.Assume the dual identity of the protagonist, Xie En/Wu Wei, and execute a step-by-step, intricately layered revenge plan. This is no reckless outburst of rage, but a calm hunt where <strong>wisdom is your spear, and rules are your shield</strong>. Driven by clear objectives, you will never lose sight of your ultimate goal—even amid intertwined romantic subplots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/1afd4d62313be621c1a0fd19617d73a7.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/1afd4d62313be621c1a0fd19617d73a7.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/1afd4d62313be621c1a0fd19617d73a7.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Workplace Is a Battlefield: Only the Victor Reigns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave behind the illusion of peaceful coexistence. Use your wits and tactics to fight your way through the labyrinth of office politics and uncover the truth! Say goodbye to monotonous gameplay: the <strong>dynamic feedback system</strong> delivers the thrill of consequences with every decision. Meticulously designed character interactions will keep your heart racing and your senses on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/aef9aca09653d8bd995e050086b1c2b2.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/aef9aca09653d8bd995e050086b1c2b2.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/aef9aca09653d8bd995e050086b1c2b2.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Branches, Multiple Endings, Parallel Storylines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts nearly <strong>50 distinct endings</strong> and hundreds of plot branches. Every dialogue choice, every mission strategy, can steer the story onto a brand-new path. Will you bring total destruction to your enemies? Or escape unscathed? Will you drown in tender affection? Or forge ahead alone into danger? Step into the game, embrace the revenge, and write an ending that is uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/944607c298579093c5ce5bcc03a70afd.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/944607c298579093c5ce5bcc03a70afd.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/944607c298579093c5ce5bcc03a70afd.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive &amp; Engaging Game Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich variety of interactive gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· In tense, high-stakes <strong>QTE sequences</strong>, you must stay absolutely calm to ensure your actions leave <strong>no trace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >· Navigate the perilous corporate environment: choose to sneak in stealthily to gain the upper hand, or step into the fray when necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e9591760d2b859df526f55fd4111410f.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e9591760d2b859df526f55fd4111410f.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/e9591760d2b859df526f55fd4111410f.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/0457c301acbe2355390bb77a3322ffb6.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/0457c301acbe2355390bb77a3322ffb6.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/0457c301acbe2355390bb77a3322ffb6.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where choices are tangled in love and hate, right and wrong. On this cold path of revenge, will these passionate emotions become your greatest vulnerability? Or your most formidable strength? Every choice that tests your humanity carries the weight of a thousand jun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/861f565876d3d2fa5e64c40034c386e0.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/861f565876d3d2fa5e64c40034c386e0.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/861f565876d3d2fa5e64c40034c386e0.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/fc246cf1800e5abd679133ac98a800ef.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/fc246cf1800e5abd679133ac98a800ef.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/fc246cf1800e5abd679133ac98a800ef.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/556facc3e38f811c190c0c5650519948.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/556facc3e38f811c190c0c5650519948.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/556facc3e38f811c190c0c5650519948.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Xie En (Wu Wei)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a wrongfully imprisoned architect, now a ruthless avenger. Under the fake identity &quot;Wu Wei&quot;, he infiltrates his former mentor's Yongqiang Group and meticulously plots his revenge—using financial tactics to dismantle everything the mentor holds dear. This high-IQ hunt walks the razor's edge between <strong>rules and human nature</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/a6d69b8fcc4ea86a6bbeeb3d3801a4ac.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/a6d69b8fcc4ea86a6bbeeb3d3801a4ac.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/a6d69b8fcc4ea86a6bbeeb3d3801a4ac.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zhang Yun'er</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;queen&quot; of Yongqiang Group, Xie En's direct supervisor and &quot;benefactor&quot;. She is a paradox of rationality and sensibility. Little does she know that the capable subordinate she personally promoted is a hunter targeting the heart of her family empire. When unyielding business pragmatism collides with uncontrollable emotion, the line between hunter and prey begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/4edabbb80afe3047835aa570c449fb4b.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/4edabbb80afe3047835aa570c449fb4b.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/4edabbb80afe3047835aa570c449fb4b.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chen Xiaoman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious corporate accountant at the group. Her meteoric rise from a dancer to a core staff member is shrouded in enigma. Her relationship with Xie En starts as a dangerous game of mutual exploitation. In a world of scheming and temptation, whoever falls in love first will lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/8beea00f49750bab31865c89fe367ca6.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/8beea00f49750bab31865c89fe367ca6.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/8beea00f49750bab31865c89fe367ca6.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guan Xinling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seemingly innocent &quot;white rabbit&quot; of the group, hiding sharp observation skills and a rebellious heart behind her sketchbook. Desperate to break free from her cage, her transformation will be the <strong>biggest wildcard</strong> in Xie En's plan. She could be his purest redemption—or his deadliest flaw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/28730e9f819e70f29622c8ff7fe0c521.poster.avif?t=1773385726\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/28730e9f819e70f29622c8ff7fe0c521.webm?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/extras/28730e9f819e70f29622c8ff7fe0c521.mp4?t=1773385726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You'll be &quot;Xie En&quot;, infiltrating the traitor's money empire. This urban hunt is a revenge saga where wit is your spear. Return as &quot;Wu Wei,&quot; using rules as your shield in a world of grey. Will you choose love or vengeance? This lethal game of cash, betrayal and redemption awaits your move.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Russian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Thai, Swedish, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/b02987151a456b03a106670bbbd6a1be9a993968/header.jpg?t=1773385726", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/d5e2e0f3cde3411086fc9a1a458431e6b105df32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773385726", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181110/d5e2e0f3cde3411086fc9a1a458431e6b105df32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773385726", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inter Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 独立显卡或集成显卡<br></li><li><strong>Dir